          "url": "https://github.com/NotchAny/notchany-registry/pull/60",
          "title": "Install APK 1.0.2: native notch selection and confirmation",
          "body": "Move multi-device selection and debug/test APK confirmation into NotchAny's native notch interface. Device serials identify selections; cancellation, timeout, malformed replies, and unknown IDs cannot continue to installation. Single-device release installation keeps its direct path.\n\nRequires NotchAny 1.0.19. The 600-second action budget covers two 120-second interactions and the existing 240-second ADB timeout. English and Chinese marketplace screenshots now show the actual native picker rendered by 1.0.19 with sample emulator entries.\n\nValidation: six isolated Python tests cover stable IDs, cancellation/timeout without installation, exact boolean confirmation, malformed replies, and ADB target/test flags; CLI package validation passed. No APK was installed during validation. Physical Android devices, full-screen/Space transitions, and multiple monitors were not exercised.\n",
